{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a6399aa9dc5a833d977c","chatId":"758548291d8845efb0498a1fb4431dcd","sessionId":null,"userId":99140,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":606,"promptTokens":416,"completionTokens":60,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:42:49"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005218152138903382,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6399aa9dc5a833d977b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483769487,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:42:49","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a6399aa9dc5a833d977b","chatId":"758548291d8845efb0498a1fb4431dcd","sessionId":null,"userId":99140,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n亚当斯教授正在指导约翰完成一个物理学实验。尽管约翰并不擅长科学，他仍努力专注于实验。工作几小时后，约翰完成了实验并发现结果是符合预期的。他松口气并给亚当斯教授打电话分享了结果。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，约翰最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 紧张\nB) 反感\nC) 惊讶\nD) 失望\nE) 绝望\nF) 释怀\n\n## 问题 2\n约翰为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他成功达到了实验的预期结果\nB) 约翰擅长的科学实验，他通常不会去做\nC) 约翰能够完成一次实验并得到令人惊讶的结果\nD) 这个实验比他预期的要简单","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005218152138903382,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6399aa9dc5a833d977c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483769484,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:42:49","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"0a66a1b8441647c7b2b99507eded874c"}